+    /// `led_cdev` must be a valid pointer to a `led_classdev` embedded within a
+    /// `led::MultiColorDevice`.
+    /// `delay_on` and `delay_off` must be valid pointers to `usize` and have
+    /// exclusive access for the period of this function.
